    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Biomancer</strong></p><p><strong>“Not all damage needs to land where it started.”</strong></p><p><strong>Strategic</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Scenario, reduce casualty severity for your faction by one step</li><li>Alternatively, convert a catastrophic loss into a contained loss with consequences</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> transferred damage becomes mutation, instability, or long-term degradation.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"biomT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Casualty Conversion</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Reduce casualty severity by one step, OR convert a catastrophic loss into a contained loss with consequences.</div>\n</div>",
